From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Steiner <tomac@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 01:20:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [iOS] Leave frameworks unsigned in builds without code
 signing

`codesign.py` signed the system frameworks it installs into a bundle
even with `--disable-code-signature`, so builds with
`ios_enable_code_signing = false` still ran `codesign` when they
embedded a framework such as LiteRT-LM's.
---
 build/config/apple/codesign.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build/config/apple/codesign.py b/build/config/apple/codesign.py
index fbb7c2f4455e6..468a370df035b 100644
--- a/build/config/apple/codesign.py
+++ b/build/config/apple/codesign.py
@@ -607,6 +607,8 @@ def InstallSystemFramework(framework_path, bundle_path, args):
             shutil.rmtree(installed_framework_path)
         shutil.copytree(framework_path, installed_framework_path)
 
+    if args.no_signature:
+        return
     CodeSignBundle(
         installed_framework_path,
         args.identity,
